{"data":{"mergeRequest":{"diffHeadSha":"25892092f1db0711fcea689c27db39f6d928d2eb","headPipeline":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Pipeline/2967491026","jobs":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"eyJpZCI6IjE3MzE1ODAyOTcwIn0"},"nodes":[{"allowFailure":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802988","name":"review-docs-cleanup","status":"MANUAL","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802988"},{"allowFailure":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802987","name":"review-docs-deploy","status":"MANUAL","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802987"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802986","name":"tests:coverage","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802986"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802985","name":"tests:integration","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802985"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802984","name":"tests:unit","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802984"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802982","name":"lint","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802982"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802981","name":"lint:comments","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802981"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802980","name":"docs hugo_build","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802980"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802979","name":"check_docs_markdown","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802979"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802978","name":"check_docs_update","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802978"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802977","name":"check_args","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802977"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802976","name":"check_embed","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802976"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802975","name":"lint_commit","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802975"},{"allowFailure":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802974","name":"check_go_generated_code","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802974"},{"allowFailure":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802973","name":"dependency-scanning-profile-0","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802973"},{"allowFailure":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802972","name":"govulncheck","status":"MANUAL","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802972"},{"allowFailure":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802971","name":"secret_detection","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802971"},{"allowFailure":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/Ci::Build/17315802970","name":"gitlab-advanced-sast","status":"SUCCESS","webPath":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/jobs/17315802970"}]},"mergeRequestEventType":"MERGED_RESULT","path":"/gitlab-org/cli/-/pipelines/2967491026","sha":"d29dd22357102fba3709a18e01c6a96e025174a3","status":"SUCCESS"},"project":{"allowMergeOnSkippedPipeline":false},"projectId":34675721,"state":"opened","approvedBy":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"eyJpZCI6IjIxODI2NzgxIn0"},"nodes":[{"bot":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/21826781","username":"GitLabDuo"}]},"notes":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"eyJjcmVhdGVkX2F0IjoiMjAyNi0xMC0yMCAxNjoyMjo0OC4wNTcwNzUwMDAgKzAwMDAiLCJpZCI6IjQwNTIwMjU1NjkifQ"},"nodes":[{"author":{"bot":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/21826781","username":"GitLabDuo"},"body":"The change looks correct. The `sbt` base resolution, the trimming, the relative-path skip and the partial-write handling are implemented as the description says. I found one minor problem: the new sbt success-message test was inserted between the Yarn test's doc comment and the Yarn test.\n\n1 finding (1 minor) across 1 file:\n\n**Minor**\n- misplaced-comment: `internal/commands/artifactregistry/login/login_test.go:320`","createdAt":"2026-10-20T12:31:01Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/4ac8a6493822a310c760a852d76c3bf3d1e8a94b","resolvable":false,"resolved":false,"resolvedBy":null},"id":"gid://gitlab/Note/4049949479","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T12:31:01Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":null,"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4049949479"},{"author":{"bot":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/21826781","username":"GitLabDuo"},"body":"**[Minor] misplaced-comment**\n\nThe new sbt test sits between the Yarn test's doc comment and the Yarn test. The comment about Yarn's token message now sits above `TestLogin_Sbt_SuccessMessageNamesEachFileAndItsVersion`. It also no longer documents `TestLogin_Yarn_SuccessMessageClaimsOnlyTheToken`, which loses its doc. Move the new test above that comment block, and give it its own doc comment.","createdAt":"2026-10-20T12:31:01Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/ddfe22cff03efeaa98ea8474688a16904ae0e973","resolvable":true,"resolved":true,"resolvedBy":{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/27667902","username":"sylviashen"}},"id":"gid://gitlab/DiffNote/4049949528","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T12:56:48Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":{"filePath":"internal/commands/artifactregistry/login/login_test.go","newLine":321,"oldLine":null},"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4049949528"},{"author":{"bot":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/21826781","username":"GitLabDuo"},"body":"I finished my review and found nothing to comment on. Nice work! :tada:\n\n- Misplaced comment from my last review: fixed. The sbt success-message test has its own doc comment, and the Yarn comment is back above the Yarn test.\n- Base resolution in `sbtCredentialsFilesFor` and `absoluteEnv`: it checks `SBT_CONFIG_HOME`, then `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` or `LOCALAPPDATA`, then `~/.config`. It trims values and skips relative ones. I found no logic problems.\n- Partial-failure handling in `loginSbt`: a first-write failure returns the raw error. A second-write failure returns the written files and an error that names them. The tests cover both orders.\n- The help text, docs and usage string agree with each other and with the success line.","createdAt":"2026-10-20T12:39:54Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/18a04798274948e1f6a9b1ef0e3c5e9abc3920b9","resolvable":false,"resolved":false,"resolvedBy":null},"id":"gid://gitlab/Note/4050018035","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T12:39:54Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":null,"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4050018035"},{"author":{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/27667902","username":"sylviashen"},"body":"Moved `TestLogin_Sbt_SuccessMessageNamesEachFileAndItsVersion` above the Yarn test's doc comment and gave it a doc comment of its own in 25892092f.","createdAt":"2026-10-20T12:56:40Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/ddfe22cff03efeaa98ea8474688a16904ae0e973","resolvable":true,"resolved":true,"resolvedBy":{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/27667902","username":"sylviashen"}},"id":"gid://gitlab/DiffNote/4050140331","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T12:56:48Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":{"filePath":"internal/commands/artifactregistry/login/login_test.go","newLine":321,"oldLine":null},"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4050140331"},{"author":{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/27667902","username":"sylviashen"},"body":"@jdrpereira @arpitgogia \n\n**Can you please review this MR?** :thankyou:","createdAt":"2026-10-20T14:21:17Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/f929b9bfaf8a77f42b116e18da646ab6e264d7bc","resolvable":true,"resolved":false,"resolvedBy":null},"id":"gid://gitlab/DiscussionNote/4050919082","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T14:21:17Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":null,"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4050919082"},{"author":{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/5054840","username":"jdrpereira"},"body":"On Windows I think this misses the path most users get. The `sbt.bat` that ships with sbt 2.x (v2.0.8, lines 727-731) passes `-Dsbt.global.base=%LOCALAPPDATA%\\sbt` whenever `LOCALAPPDATA` is set, and `BuildPaths.getGlobalBase` uses that property as is, without the `\\2`. So with the stock 2.x launcher, both 1.x and 2.x builds read `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\sbt\\credentials.sbt`, and we write neither of the files they read but still print the green check. The 1.x launchers don't have this line, so it only shows up once someone installs sbt 2 (scoop already ships 2.0.11).\n\nCould we also write `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\sbt\\credentials.sbt` on Windows? With a 1.x launcher nothing reads it, so it does no harm. The help text and docs would need the same update.","createdAt":"2026-10-20T16:22:47Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/55bb7312299fb319489710a0e78b15aba5ed3d83","resolvable":true,"resolved":false,"resolvedBy":null},"id":"gid://gitlab/DiffNote/4052025509","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T16:22:47Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":{"filePath":"internal/commands/artifactregistry/login/sbt.go","newLine":138,"oldLine":null},"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4052025509"},{"author":{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/5054840","username":"jdrpereira"},"body":"\"~/.config/sbt/2 by default\" is not true on Windows, where `LOCALAPPDATA` is basically always set. Maybe keep the flag usage short, like \"Writes credentials.sbt to the sbt 1.x and 2.x global bases.\", and leave the paths to the long help?","createdAt":"2026-10-20T16:22:48Z","discussion":{"id":"gid://gitlab/Discussion/8afff014b3db3f6d57def1974433775f42203479","resolvable":true,"resolved":false,"resolvedBy":null},"id":"gid://gitlab/DiffNote/4052025569","lastEditedAt":"2026-10-20T16:22:48Z","lastEditedBy":null,"position":{"filePath":"internal/commands/artifactregistry/login/login.go","newLine":113,"oldLine":null},"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4157#note_4052025569"}]},"reviewers":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"eyJpZCI6IjUwNTQ4NDAifQ"},"nodes":[{"bot":true,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/21826781","username":"GitLabDuo","mergeRequestInteraction":{"reviewState":"APPROVED"}},{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/12347103","username":"arpitgogia","mergeRequestInteraction":{"reviewState":"UNREVIEWED"}},{"bot":false,"id":"gid://gitlab/User/5054840","username":"jdrpereira","mergeRequestInteraction":{"reviewState":"REQUESTED_CHANGES"}}]}}}}